# Render intermediates. The render and package tools regenerate these from the
# .blend sources; only the game atlases (sheets/) and previews are tracked.
assets/**/masters/exr/
assets/**/masters/layers/
assets/**/masters/shadow-silhouettes/
assets/**/masters/render-inputs.json
assets/**/frames/
# The depot preview and packaging tools composite these small connector frames.
!assets/depots/connectors/frames/
assets/depots/connectors/masters/
assets/depots/connectors/layers/
